      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Use the default allocation for the pixel memory. Will typically result in a Bitmap.Config.HARDWARE allocation, but may be software for small images. In addition, this will switch to software when HARDWARE is incompatible, e.g. setMutableRequired(true) or setDecodeAsAlphaMaskEnabled(true).</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/graphics/ImageDecoder#ALLOCATOR_DEFAULT" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.graphics.ImageDecoder.ALLOCATOR_DEFAULT</code>.</a></format></para>
